    {
      "uid": "zhcn:879e9abb9faacc056936f812",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“下一个目标是‘伊丽莎白女王杯’！\n平常很照顾我的菱亚说不定也会出赛，\n我要拿出干劲努力才行！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "9799951f75c00034398404390234ab7d01864cc1300c7277ef722869e0335fef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
