      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“──我鼓足干劲上场的结果是……第一名！！\n再来就看我的表现是不是足以\n将心意传递给她了──”",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c574fcbe4e0914af9fa8a6feb5ded8aa6241f12929124e7de7406a34bb81016",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
