      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“结果她说愿意再坚持一下！\n还说我的表现……闪、闪亮亮的，\n所以她想成为第二个‘盛冈之星’！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "396b2564033c400c8ad88fdb111aeb3aaa2dc5641cef3915c83338f91d486fe5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
