      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“那我身为头号‘盛冈之星’也不能输！\n等一下要跟村里的大家开庆功宴了，\n我先养精蓄锐，明天也要继续加油呐！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "8352587270a6c2789609f67d9ff1b7248379c9bbdcbeef02e84269da4ae11491",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
